<title>POLAND: Polifarb W sees '97 net at PLN 22.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Polifarb W sees '97 net at PLN 22.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish paintmaker Polifarb Wroclaw SA expects to make a net profit of 22.2 million zlotys in 1997 on a pre-tax profit of 37.4 million zlotys on sales of 255.4 million zlotys, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Over the first 11 months of 1996 Polifarb Wroclaw earned net 19.5 million zlotys and had a pre-tax profit of 33 million zlotys and sales of 196 million zlotys.</p>
<p>The company has said it seeks to merge with Polifarb Cieszyn by mid-year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
